        "detail": "Caption · 1",
        "text": "Meet Pumba - he is my little bros incredibly adorable rescue pup who was a little too scared to cross the road this morning."
      },
      {
        "platform": "Instagram",
        "detail": "Caption · 2",
        "text": "As Canva has grown *everything* has had to change and evolve too. On people’s birthday we have always tried to do something a little special, people could choose a birthday meal that our amazing Vibe team would create - we now have more birthdays than work days in the year so had to iterate, here’s their latest creation, The Birthday Wheel. Our team is the best 😂"
      },
      {
        "platform": "Instagram",
        "detail": "Caption · 3",
        "text": "First of Jan in Rio and my first insta post ☺️ Love getting away each year and getting to know a little more of this big, beautiful, chaotic, crazy world we live in. Always leave with a few life lessons and Brazil has certainly not disappointed."
      }
